# Search-noise exclusions for ripgrep-based agent tools.
# Everything here is still readable by naming the path explicitly; these rules
# only stop exploratory greps and globs from pulling large generated or
# machine-readable content into context.

# Vendored skill evaluation fixtures (~780 KB JSON, never used for project work)
.agents/skills/*/evals/

# Generated code: sqlc (~370 KB) and mocks (~110 KB).
# db/queries/ and each feature's interfaces.go are the sources of truth.
internal/database/sqlc/
internal/**/mocks/

# Machine-readable contracts and diagram sources; use docs/api/*.md instead
docs/contracts/
web/api-docs/vendor/
docs/diagrams/

# Dependency checksums; go.mod carries the useful version data
go.sum

# Local scratch and prior-tool history
tmp/
.aider*
